    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present this impeccably finished three-bedroom terraced family home to the Dublin 10 market. This property has been meticulously maintained and thoughtfully extended, resulting in a home that is truly in walk-in condition.\n\nLocated in a mature and popular residential pocket of Ballyfermot, Landen Road is within easy reach of a wealth of local amenities including shops, schools, and Markievicz Park. The area is exceptionally well-connected with frequent bus routes to the City Centre and easy access to the N7 and M50 motorways.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation is designed for modern living. A bright front living room features warm wood flooring and a contemporary electric fireplace, creating a cosy focal point. To the rear, the property has been impressively extended to host a stunning open-plan kitchen and living area. This space is finished with sleek tiling throughout and boasts a premium fully fitted kitchen with ample countertop space and extensive storage solutions. A stylish, fully tiled family bathroom completes the ground floor layout.\n\nOn the middle floor, you will find three well-proportioned bedrooms, all featuring generous fitted wardrobes. One of these bedrooms benefits from its own private, fully tiled en suite.\n\nA particular highlight of this home is the attic, which has been tastefully converted to a high standard. Currently acting as a fourth bedroom and a separate study area, this versatile space is fully carpeted and provides significant extra square footage for a growing family.\n\nThe exterior of the property is just as impressive. The rear garden features a low-maintenance paved area, perfect for outdoor entertaining, along with a large, solid-structure shed providing excellent additional storage or workshop potential.\n\nViewing is highly advised. Call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing!\n\nKey Features:\n\nc. 87 sq m\nBER D1\nExtended three-bedroom terraced home\nImmaculately presented throughout\nStunning modern kitchen with sleek tiled flooring\nOpen-plan rear living and dining extension\nOff street parking \nGas central heating\nFeature electric fireplace and wood flooring in front lounge\nThree bedrooms with ample fitted wardrobes\nPrimary bedroom with fully tiled ensuite\nTastefully converted attic currently acting as a fourth bedroom\nLarge rear shed and low-maintenance paved garden\nTurn-key condition for any prospective buyer\nIdeal for first time buyers, and growing families\n\n \nDirections:\nTraveling along the Ballyfermot Road toward the City Centre, pass the Gala Shopping Centre on your left. Take the right-hand turn onto Kylemore Road at the main junction. Continue straight and take the left turn onto Langan Road. Follow the road around, and Number 68 will be located on your left-hand side, identified by our for sale sign.\n"
      },
